{"id":"ca227784015c4bc0","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-yoneda.md","title":"Yoneda Lemma for Presheaves","display":"thm-yoneda — Yoneda Lemma for Presheaves","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-yoneda","aliases":["58-thm-yoneda"],"display":"thm-yoneda — Yoneda Lemma for Presheaves","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-representable.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-yoneda"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-yoneda</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-yoneda — Yoneda Lemma for Presheaves"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f5113ef45d8213e\" href=\"?note=1f5113ef45d8213e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-representable.md\">../batch11/58-df-representable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,A,h_A,F,\\eta,\\xi,\\Phi_A,N\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,A,h_A,F,\\eta,\\xi,\\Phi_A,N\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S,\\mathrm{Functor}_S,\\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S,\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S,\\mathrm{Functor}_S,\\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S,\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S\\)</span>（上游谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>（函数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformationSet}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformationSet}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（此处定义的自然变换集值关系）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}natural\\text{-}transformation\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformationSet}_S(N;h_A,F,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\nN=\\{\\eta\\in V:\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,h_A,F,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}natural\\text{-}transformation\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformationSet}_S(N;h_A,F,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\nN=\\{\\eta\\in V:\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,h_A,F,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}yoneda}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S(h_A,A,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\n\\exists N,\\Phi_A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformationSet}_S(N;h_A,F,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\Phi_A,N,F(A)\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi_A)=F(A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\eta\\in N\\;\n\\bigl(\\Phi_A(\\eta)=\\eta(A)(\\operatorname{id}_A)\n\\land\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S(\\eta,A,F,\\Phi_A(\\eta),\\mathcal C)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\xi\\in F(A)\\;\\exists!\\eta\\in N\\;\n\\bigl(\\Phi_A(\\eta)=\\xi\n\\land\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S(\\eta,A,F,\\xi,\\mathcal C)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}yoneda}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S(h_A,A,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\n\\exists N,\\Phi_A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformationSet}_S(N;h_A,F,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\Phi_A,N,F(A)\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi_A)=F(A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\eta\\in N\\;\n\\bigl(\\Phi_A(\\eta)=\\eta(A)(\\operatorname{id}_A)\n\\land\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S(\\eta,A,F,\\Phi_A(\\eta),\\mathcal C)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\xi\\in F(A)\\;\\exists!\\eta\\in N\\;\n\\bigl(\\Phi_A(\\eta)=\\xi\n\\land\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S(\\eta,A,F,\\xi,\\mathcal C)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_A\">\\(\\Phi_A\\)</span> is now an explicitly quantified function with the natural-transformation set as domain and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(A)\">\\(F(A)\\)</span> as its exact range.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S\\)</span> expands the inverse clause to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_X(g)=F(g^{\\operatorname{op}})(\\xi)\">\\(\\eta_X(g)=F(g^{\\operatorname{op}})(\\xi)\\)</span>; uniqueness supplies injectivity as well as the inverse family.</li>\n<li>The bijection is natural in both <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>; the covariant dual uses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,-)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,-)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-representable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1f5113ef45d8213e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-representable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$（函数谓词，见 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,A,h_A,F,\\eta,\\xi,\\Phi_A,N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S,\\mathrm{Functor}_S,\\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S,\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformationSet}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}yoneda\\text{-}natural\\text{-}transformation\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformationSet}_S(N;h_A,F,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\nN=\\{\\eta\\in V:\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,h_A,F,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}yoneda}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S(h_A,A,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\\\\n\\to{}&\n\\exists N,\\Phi_A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformationSet}_S(N;h_A,F,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\Phi_A,N,F(A)\\bigr)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\Phi_A)=F(A)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\eta\\in N\\;\n\\bigl(\\Phi_A(\\eta)=\\eta(A)(\\operatorname{id}_A)\n\\land\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S(\\eta,A,F,\\Phi_A(\\eta),\\mathcal C)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\xi\\in F(A)\\;\\exists!\\eta\\in N\\;\n\\bigl(\\Phi_A(\\eta)=\\xi\n\\land\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S(\\eta,A,F,\\xi,\\mathcal C)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_A","display":false},{"tex":"F(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_X(g)=F(g^{\\operatorname{op}})(\\xi)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,-)","display":false}],"bytes":2330,"backlinks":[{"id":"5caf5b54bcc1111e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4495","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-thm-yoneda.md|58-thm-yoneda]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["1f5113ef45d8213e","970e2b8779070da0","877f1061e295cf5f","8790486ac053461c","36d7463d215be751","e637becf421e4e61"]}